## Graphical Abstract
Highlights:
• Mucor was used as a template for the assembly of ZIF-8
• ZIF-8@Mucor membrane was formed by the in-situ growing of ZIF-8 on hyphae
• In-situ growing ZIF-8@Mucor has smaller size and more uniform distribution of
ZIF-8.
• ZIF-8 in the membrane exhibited high adsorption capacity for $\mathrm{Pb^{2+}}\left(1443.29\mathrm{mg/g}\right)$ .
